WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:17.689
Skyler: We only have four things left.

2
00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:20.087
Riley: Goldie and Goofy.

3
00:00:20.088 --> 00:00:23.991
Sarah: And my two beautiful balloons.

4
00:00:23.992 --> 00:00:28.224
Theo: Snooks likes the balloons too.

5
00:00:28.225 --> 00:00:29.988
Snooks: Woof! Woof!

6
00:00:29.989 --> 00:00:32.874
Riley: Down, Snooks.

7
00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:37.087
Sarah: Oops!

8
00:00:37.088 --> 00:00:41.617
Ben: There go the balloons!

9
00:00:41.618 --> 00:00:43.983
Snooks: A-rooo!

10
00:00:43.984 --> 00:00:46.418
Riley: Bad dog, Snooks!

11
00:00:46.419 --> 00:00:49.519
I can't believe you did that!

12
00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:53.591
Ben: We started out with ten things.

13
00:00:53.592 --> 00:00:57.953
Skyler: Now we only have two left—Goldie and Goofy.

14
00:00:57.954 --> 00:01:00.295
Theo: Kids are going inside.

15
00:01:00.296 --> 00:01:04.663
The party is starting!

16
00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:07.919
Sarah: What if the pet shop owner won't let us in?

17
00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:14.009
Skyler: That's right. We only have two things.

18
00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:17.318
Ben: Two is better than none.

19
00:01:17.319 --> 00:01:22.218
Theo: And Mr. Lin, the pet shop owner, is very nice.

20
00:01:22.219 --> 00:01:25.963
Theo: Maybe he won't mind that we only have two things.

21
00:01:25.964 --> 00:01:31.574
Riley: He might be glad to see Goldie and Goofy again.

22
00:01:31.575 --> 00:01:33.495
Theo: Ben's right.

23
00:01:33.496 --> 00:01:35.524
Skyler: Okay, let's go.

24
00:01:35.525 --> 00:01:41.742
Riley: Snooks, you stay outside in the pet playpen.

25
00:01:41.743 --> 00:01:50.393
And behave yourself!

26
00:01:50.394 --> 00:01:57.945
Ben: Look. There's Mr. Lin.

27
00:01:57.946 --> 00:02:01.754
Mr. Lin: Hello, Ben. Hello, Riley.

28
00:02:01.755 --> 00:02:07.382
What's in your bag?

29
00:02:07.383 --> 00:02:09.443
Riley: My guppies.

30
00:02:09.444 --> 00:02:19.072
Mr. Lin: My goodness. Ten guppies!

31
00:02:19.073 --> 00:02:21.394
Riley: What?

32
00:02:21.395 --> 00:02:26.585
Ben: Oh my gosh.

33
00:02:26.586 --> 00:02:29.238
There are ten guppies!

34
00:02:29.239 --> 00:02:32.721
Riley: We have ten things after all!

35
00:02:32.722 --> 00:02:37.324
Mr. Lin: Put them in front with all the other things.

36
00:02:37.325 --> 00:02:41.103
Sarah: How did two guppies turn into ten guppies?

37
00:02:41.104 --> 00:02:54.208
Ben: Oh boy! Goldie and Goofy had babies!
